        "mission_intent": "We need to stand up a formal Risk Management Council for the agency in line with OMB Circular A-123 guidance on enterprise risk management. Please draft a charter and governance framework for the RMC that defines its membership composition, meeting cadence, escalation protocols, and integration points with existing management structures. The charter should specify that the council includes senior officials representing both program operations and mission-support functions so we can surface risks with the most significant impact on agency mission outcomes. We also want to incorporate a Chief Risk Officer function\u2014either a dedicated CRO position or an equivalent role\u2014who will serve as a strategic advisor on integrating ERM practices into day-to-day operations and decision-making and who will work with business unit managers to identify issues in a timely manner. Please ensure the framework addresses how the CRO will develop the strategically-aligned portfolio view of risks and how that view feeds into the RMC's deliberations on risk response. Have the draft charter ready for senior leadership review by the end of next week.",
